    "text": "<p>Consider the following three statements:</p><p><math><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is a prime number</p><p><math><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is a factor of <math><mn>192</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>LCM</mi></math>&nbsp;of <math><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mn>7</mn></math> is <math><mn>35</mn></math></p><p>Then the truth value of which one of the following statements is true?</p>",
